{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gK7uQtU7231793174738.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據了解，宏福苑大火獨立委員會提交的報告最快明天公開，政府並公布一系列改革措施，成立督導委員會，確保措施落實。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203236-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E6%93%9A%E6%82%89%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E8%A8%AD%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E6%9C%83%E8%90%BD%E5%AF%A6%E5%8F%8A%E7%9B%A3%E7%9D%A3%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD%E5%8A%A0%E5%BC%B7%E6%B6%88%E9%98%B2%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%A7%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E8%A6%8F%E7%AE%A1%E7%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>宏福苑｜據悉政府設委員會落實及監督改革措施　加強消防安全及大維修規管等</strong></a></p><p></p><p>科大籌建本港第三間醫學院，校方指教研設施、課程發展等工作進度良好，有信心按原定計劃，在28/29學年錄取首批50名學生。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203234-%E7%A7%91%E5%A4%A7%E6%8C%87%E7%B1%8C%E5%BB%BA%E9%86%AB%E5%AD%B8%E9%99%A2%E9%80%B2%E5%BA%A6%E8%89%AF%E5%A5%BD%E6%9C%89%E4%BF%A1%E5%BF%83%E6%8C%89%E8%A8%88%E5%8A%832829%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4%E9%8C%84%E5%8F%96%E9%A6%96%E6%89%B950%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%B8%E7%94%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>科大指籌建醫學院進度良好　有信心按計劃28/29學年錄取首批50名學生</strong></a></p><p></p><p>運輸及物流局局長陳美寶指，正積極在應對飛機短缺的同時，擴大本地航空運力，包括商討航權，及開拓與大灣區城市的連接。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203235-%E9%99%B3%E7%BE%8E%E5%AF%B6%E6%8C%87%E7%A9%8D%E6%A5%B5%E6%93%B4%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E8%88%AA%E7%A9%BA%E9%81%8B%E5%8A%9B%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E5%95%86%E8%A8%8E%E8%88%AA%E6%AC%8A%E5%8F%8A%E9%96%8B%E6%8B%93%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%8E%E5%B8%82%E9%80%A3%E6%8E%A5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>陳美寶指積極擴大本地航空運力　包括商討航權及開拓與大灣區城市連接</strong></a></p><p></p><p>創新科技及工業局局長孫東出席全球大學校長及領袖高峰會教育論壇時表示，已有七間本地大學簽署協議，落戶北都大學城起動旗艦「河套學研壹號」。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203232-%E5%AD%AB%E6%9D%B1%E4%B8%83%E9%96%93%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%B8%E7%B0%BD%E7%BD%B2%E5%8D%94%E8%AD%B0%E8%90%BD%E6%88%B6%E5%8C%97%E9%83%BD%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%B8%E5%9F%8E%E8%B5%B7%E5%8B%95%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E6%B2%B3%E5%A5%97%E5%AD%B8%E7%A0%94%E5%A3%B9%E8%99%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>孫東︰七間本地大學簽署協議　落戶北都大學城起動旗艦「河套學研壹號」</strong></a></p><p></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:39.276343+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":397,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.329742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:48.929073+00:00","content_hash":"bfdc51e902668c8f45a6a3c41f12688418bd8af8c9feabd9a69eea3286c53e88","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:39.276343+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}